<title>NETHERLANDS: Rabobank initiates EVC as a hold.</title>
<headline>Rabobank initiates EVC as a hold.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of March research.</p>
<p>Company-------------Sector--------Price---Broker-----------</p>
<p>EVC International   chemicals     53.00   Rabo Securities</p>
<p>COMMENT: HOLD (Introduction). For 1997, EVC expects some improvement after it suffered a loss in 1996. Strengths: market leader in Europe for PVC. Strong financial position. Earnings should rise this year and next. No important capacity expansion planned in Europe. New technology could significantly reduce production costs after 2000. Weaknesses: Highly cyclical business. Slow growth in demand in Europe. Competition from other materials. Resturucturing to continue for some more years.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS	 P/E	P/CF   Dividend</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)    -1.75	n.a.     4.7    3.00</p>
<p>    1997		 +4.00	13.2     3.9    3.00</p>
<p>    1998		 +6.50	 8.2     3.1    3.00</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
